{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Lauf_h\u00f6her,_als_dein_Kaffeekonsum_\u2013_und_das_will_was_hei\u00dfen!.jpg?t=1751132940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 Mesorift Survival \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mesorift Survival</strong> offers a classic survival experience with an exciting mix of PvP and PvE \u2013 set in a dangerous, tropical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast open-world map made up of three islands \u2013 one large main island and two smaller ones. You'll encounter dense jungle vegetation, abandoned bunker facilities, and old radio towers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Survival Start</strong><br>You begin your journey on the beach \u2013 with nothing. Gather wood, stone, and other materials to craft your first tools like an axe and pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dinosaurs</strong> <br>Due to a failed experiment, dinosaurs are now roaming the island \u2013 neither the bunker nor the radio tower facility was spared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PvP and PvE Elements</strong><br>In addition to AI threats, other players can be just as deadly. Will you form alliances or trust no one?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resources &amp; Exploration</strong><br>Venture deeper into the wilderness to discover valuable resources like oil, silver, copper, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Construct and upgrade your own base. Craft useful tools and powerful weapons to defend yourself and dominate the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/BaseBuilding_Gif.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Own Dedicated Server</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Server Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player count, camera settings, max dino spawns, password, PvP or PvE mode, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Gif_5.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether solo or with friends \u2013 <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790650?t=1751132940","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/bf9eedf87b627508b34c5e857865043175d6eabc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751132940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/532d1d0d1e40d2c408a61bcf9533350a3710e31b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751132940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/532d1d0d1e40d2c408a61bcf9533350a3710e31b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751132940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Lauf_h\u00f6her,_als_dein_Kaffeekonsum_\u2013_und_das_will_was_hei\u00dfen!.jpg?t=1751132940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 Mesorift Survival \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mesorift Survival</strong> offers a classic survival experience with an exciting mix of PvP and PvE \u2013 set in a dangerous, tropical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast open-world map made up of three islands \u2013 one large main island and two smaller ones. You'll encounter dense jungle vegetation, abandoned bunker facilities, and old radio towers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Survival Start</strong><br>You begin your journey on the beach \u2013 with nothing. Gather wood, stone, and other materials to craft your first tools like an axe and pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dinosaurs</strong> <br>Due to a failed experiment, dinosaurs are now roaming the island \u2013 neither the bunker nor the radio tower facility was spared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PvP and PvE Elements</strong><br>In addition to AI threats, other players can be just as deadly. Will you form alliances or trust no one?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resources &amp; Exploration</strong><br>Venture deeper into the wilderness to discover valuable resources like oil, silver, copper, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Construct and upgrade your own base. Craft useful tools and powerful weapons to defend yourself and dominate the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/BaseBuilding_Gif.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Own Dedicated Server</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Server Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player count, camera settings, max dino spawns, password, PvP or PvE mode, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/Gif_5.gif?t=1751132940\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether solo or with friends \u2013 <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>","developers":["HolyMaskGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/44c34a4b6fe1d8c8cd00e1df76712ffa735456d1/header.jpg?t=